				"description": "The PMK-4 (Russian: Противогаз Масочный Коробочный — \"Masked Boxed Gas mask\")  full face mask with a large speech diaphragm similar to those on preceding PMK-series masks. The PMK-4 was released into service at the same time as the PMK-S, and is part of the current issue Russian \"Ratnik\" program. The mask is designed to protect against all CBRN threats, and is produced to a very high quality and comfort standard."
			}
		},
